[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11660.469, "timestamp": "03:14:20", "text": "兄弟"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11663.389, "timestamp": "03:14:23", "text": "わかった、私は怒っている、私は怒っている"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11667.19, "timestamp": "03:14:27", "text": "腹が立つ、あれはどこだ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11670.51, "timestamp": "03:14:30", "text": "銃 ゲームで見たあの銃はどこにあるの？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11672.03, "timestamp": "03:14:32", "text": "p"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11682.63, "timestamp": "03:14:42", "text": "えーと、神話級の銃ですよね、えーと、そうじゃないです"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11698.469, "timestamp": "03:14:58", "text": "もう十分だよ、あぁ、使い方がわからない"}]